    {
      "block_id": 1,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "Decimal numbers above the illustrations represent low-resolution \ncycles. Decimal numbers below the illustrations represent high- \nresolution cycies. Negative numbers indicate the start of data \nfetch for displays that are larger than normal.\n",
