    {
      "block_id": 3,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "Hardware stop installed here. Data fetches which occur at \ncyde $18 or sooner will wipe out al the sprites (by defining \nan extra wide display), but leave the audio and disk DMA \nuntouched. However, if only SPRITEO is desired to function, \nthen tie data fetches cannot begin any sooner than cyde $1C\n",
