        0.8697869636110284,
        0.6151120920426725
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": 4,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "Some sprites are unusable if the display starts early due to \nan extra word(s) associated with a wide display and or \nhorizontal scrolling. In this case, the hit plane DMA steals \nthe cycles normally allocated to the sprites, as illustrated \nabove.\n",
